sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Respondent
    participant P as Survey page
    participant A as Hono API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant FS as Firestore
    actor O as Operator

    Note over U,FS: 1. Submit a response (with an optional file)
    opt File question
        P->>A: POST /api/files (multipart file)
        A->>A: re-check type and size (max 700 KB)
        A->>FS: files/{fileId} = name, type, base64
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end
    U->>P: Submit answers
    P->>P: zodResolver validates (client)
    P->>A: POST /api/forms/:id/submissions
    A->>PG: load form + questions
    A->>A: buildAnswerSchema(questions) validates body
    alt Invalid answers
        A-->>P: 400 invalid_answers + issues
    else Unknown file id
        A->>FS: file exists?
        A-->>P: 400 Unknown file
    else Valid
        A->>PG: nested create: Submission + Answers (one transaction)
        PG-->>A: saved row
        A->>FS: transaction: set submission, responseCount +1 only if new
        Note over A,FS: a Firestore failure is logged, not returned
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end

    Note over U,FS: 2. Read with fallback
    P->>A: GET /api/forms/:id
    A->>PG: primary read
    alt Postgres answers (a row or null)
        PG-->>A: form or null (null becomes 404)
    else Postgres throws (unreachable)
        PG--xA: error (logged)
        A->>FS: fallback read forms/{id}
        FS-->>A: form or null
    end
    A-->>P: 200 form, or 404

    Note over O,FS: 3. Repair after an outage or a restore
    O->>A: GET /api/sync/status (Bearer token)
    A->>PG: form ids and submission count
    A->>FS: form ids and submission counts
    A-->>O: missingInFirestore, onlyInFirestore, inSync
    O->>A: POST /api/sync (Bearer token)
    A->>PG: read all forms and submissions
    A->>FS: replace documents, set real counters
    A->>FS: delete forms that no longer exist in Postgres
    A-->>O: forms, submissions, removed